- Har bir foydalanuvchiga xos va kam o''qiladigan ma''lumot — hit rate past bo''ladi.
- Pul va huquqlar bilan bog''liq qarorlar — eskirgan ruxsat xavfsizlik teshigi.

Hit rate''ni metrikaga chiqaring. 60 foizdan past bo''lsa, kesh ehtimol foydadan ko''ra murakkablik qo''shyapti.', 'bekzod', 24, '{redis,caching,performance,backend}', 7, '2026-09-13 14:11:00+00', '2026-09-13 14:11:00+00', 49, 'https://picsum.photos/seed/lightning-speed/1200/630', 'Cache-aside, TTL, stampede va invalidatsiya bo''yicha amaliy tajriba', 'redis-kesh-tezlik-va-noto-g-ri-ma-lumot-o-rtasidagi-muvozana-3f5e24c2', 'published', '2026-09-13 14:11:00+00', 2, NULL, 77, NULL, '') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

